@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = 替换为你的管理员 token
@userId = 替换为用户 id
@roomId = 替换为练习房 id

### admin login
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### update user status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "NORMAL"
}

### ledger games
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/ledger-games
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### practice rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/practice-rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### close practice room
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/practice-rooms/{{roomId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### risk logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/risk-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### system config
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-config
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

